          "heading": "Will Joseph presses England claims following standout Gloucester victory over Harlequins",
          "body": "Gloucester centre Will Joseph has strengthened his case for international honours after an impressive display in Saturday’s 48-0 Premiership victory over Harlequins. Joseph was central to a rampant Gloucester backline, crossing for one of his side's eight tries in a dominant performance at Kingsholm. While the result leaves Harlequins winless after two rounds, the form of the young English centre has provided a timely boost for his prospects ahead of the upcoming international window."
