          "kicker": "Head-to-head",
          "heading": "France prepares to face Fiji following previous victory last November",
          "body": "France returns to action against Fiji in Round 4, looking to build on a current log position of 3rd place. In their last meeting, which took place in November 2025 during the International Friendlies, France secured a 34-21 victory over Fiji on home soil. Les Bleus head into this fixture with 2 wins and 1 loss from their 3 matches in the current Nations Championship, having scored 116 points and conceded 75 for a points difference of +41."
