          "kicker": "Historical Context",
          "heading": "Italy Men’s XV Reflect on Previous World Ranking Peaks",
          "body": "As the squad prepares for their upcoming fixture against South Africa, they look back on their progression in the international rankings. The Azzurri reached their best-ever world ranking of No. 8 on two occasions, first in 2007 and most recently in 2024. Following a challenging opening series in the 2026 Nations Championship, the team now aims to build on that historical benchmark during their November test matches in Turin, Genoa, and Udine."
