          "kicker": "WXV series",
          "heading": "Scotland women’s side suffer heavy home defeat against visiting Australia",
          "body": "The Scotland women's side were defeated 30-10 by Australia in their WXV Global Series match at Hive Stadium. Despite leading 10-5 at half-time through an Evie Gallagher try and points from Helen Nelson, Scotland conceded 25 unanswered points in the second half. The match saw Scotland's Gallagher receive a 10-minute sin-bin during a pivotal eight-minute period where the Wallaroos scored three tries to secure their first victory of the season."
