          "heading": "Josh Adams eyes Australia return as Wales winger targets third World Cup",
          "body": "Wales wing Josh Adams has confirmed he is back in training and targeting a return to action this month after missing the July tour with a calf injury. The 31-year-old, who has 72 caps, is looking to reach his third global tournament and remains eager to feature in next year's competition in Australia. As Wales begin their countdown to the opening pool match against Zimbabwe, Adams is prioritising a healthy return to domestic play to secure his spot in future international squads."
