          "body": "As the senior men’s side prepares for their upcoming autumn fixtures, it is worth noting that Argentina reached their best-ever world ranking of No. 3 during the 2007–08 period. The national team currently sits 8th in the tournament standings, following a recent defeat to England. Los Pumas will look to improve on their current standing of 1 win from 3 matches when they face Ireland in their next test."
