          "kicker": "Disciplinary blow",
          "heading": "Hunter Paisami suspended for four matches following dangerous tackle incident",
          "body": "Wallabies centre Hunter Paisami has been ruled out of the upcoming Bledisloe Cup series after failing to overturn a four-match suspension. Paisami was cited for a dangerous tackle on Springboks fly-half Sacha Feinberg-Mngomezulu during the recent victory in Perth. Following a hearing, the disciplinary committee determined the action warranted a six-match entry point, reduced to four due to mitigating factors. Consequently, Les Kiss has called up Queensland Reds full-back Jock Campbell to the squad to bolster the backline options."
        }
