          "heading": "Japan women's side fall to seven-try defeat against Ireland away",
          "body": "The Japan women's side concluded their latest tour with a 43-19 defeat to Ireland at Virgin Media Park in Cork on Saturday. Despite an early try from Sakurako Korai, the Sakura XV struggled to contain the Irish attack, conceding seven tries throughout the contest. Nami Asari and Nijiho Nagata also crossed the whitewash for the visitors, but Ireland maintained control to secure consecutive victories. This result follows their earlier narrow defeat in the WXV Global Series encounter in Galway."
