          "kicker": "Transfer news",
          "heading": "Dane Gagai cleared for New Zealand rugby union eligibility switch",
          "body": "Dane Gagai has been cleared to switch his rugby league eligibility from Australia to New Zealand, opening a potential path into the 15-man code. The cross-code eligibility clearance marks a notable development for New Zealand rugby as authorities evaluate player resources across elite international competitions."
